    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="abstract">

                <pb facs="0003" n="[I]" xml:id="pgI"/>

                <head>Papers relating to the treaty of Washington.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">Volume II–Geneva arbitration.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">Containing the remainder of the papers accompanying the
                    Counter Case of the United States; Counter Case of Her Britannic Majesty’s
                    government; instructions to the agent and counsel of the United States, and
                    proceedings at Geneva in December, 1871, and April, 1872; correspondence
                    respecting the Geneva arbitration and the proposed supplemental article to the
                    treaty; and declaration of Sir Stafford Northcote at Exeter.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
